  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Security Report/UCDP 2008-2011 - Human Security Report</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Human Security Report/UCDP 2008-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att  avg&#xf6;ra policyrelevansen och tillg&#xe4;ngligg&#xf6;ra             forskningen om globala och regionala trender vg politiskt v&#xe5;ld, dess  orsaker och konsekvenser f&#xf6;r policysf&#xe4;ren, forskare, media och        allm&#xe4;nhet. Tv&#xe5; delkomponenter Uppsala Konfliktdatabas och Human       Security Report som produceras vid Simon Fraser University,           Vancouver.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to conduct and commission research on global and       regional trends in political violence, their causes and consequences, to determine the policy-relevance of this resarch and to make it      accessible to the policy and research communities, the media and      interested public. Two components; the Uppsala Conflict Database and  the Human Security Report at Simon Fraser University, Vancouver.</narrative>
  </description>
